<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 5.8 bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 5.8 bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan accepted 5.8 billion rupees in its weekly open market operation in short-term federal bonds on Wednesday:</p>
<p>			    Offered    Accepted    Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale	   7,645	3,300	 15.00 pct/yr</p>
<p>Five-month repo	 5,700	2,500	 14.90 pct/yr</p>
<p>Total		    13,345	5,800</p>
<p>($1=40.62 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
